msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Suggested Parts List"
msgstr "传统直升机——建议零部件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:8
#: f133bfcbdc834a9c8b5cdca227b56067
msgid "Electronics Including Autopilot"
msgstr "电子设备（含飞控）"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:10
#: e7a21b8d63f34e7b8e39f663cb0ca85c
msgid ""
":ref:`An ArduPilot supported board <common-autopilots>` with :ref:`GPS and "
"external compass <common-positioning-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ArduPilot 支持的飞控板 <common-autopilots>`，配备 :ref:`GPS 和外部罗盘 <common-"
"positioning-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:13
#: 388d0b89e6284d5c8575b5529c72e9dc
msgid "RC helicopter frame"
msgstr "RC 直升机机架"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:15
#: e98c3ad833b54487b8ea09b3f612d16e
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports single rotor with conventional or direct drive tail, "
"tandem rotor, or collective pitch quad-rotor helicopter frames."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持配备传统或直驱尾桨的单旋翼、串联旋翼或共轴四旋翼直升机机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:18
#: f80b5763df60431aa4877a48c3fa81bc
msgid ""
"The program can be configured to fly flybar or flybarless, with CCPM swash "
"mixing or single-servo (H1) swash types. The system has flown helicopters "
"ranging from micro size with a Pixracer to large piston and turbine powered "
"machines."
msgstr ""
"程序可以配置为带平衡杆或无平衡杆飞行，支持 CCPM 倾斜盘混控或单舵机（H1）倾斜盘类型。该系统已驾驶过从配备 Pixracer "
"的微型直升机到大型活塞和涡轮动力机器的各种尺寸直升机。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:24
#: bd7adb742a99401cbac28afba1cabcb2
msgid "8-channel Transmitter / Receiver"
msgstr "8 通道遥控器/接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:26
#: ae81400fe89446b9aafda491fce7b8d7
msgid ""
"Your transmitter & receiver must support minimum 8 channels (elevator, "
"aileron, collective pitch, rudder, flight mode, tuning knob, auxiliary "
"function switch, throttle hold)."
msgstr "您的遥控器和接收机必须支持至少 8 个通道（升降、副翼、总距、方向舵、飞行模式、调参旋钮、辅助功能开关、油门锁定）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:31
#: fce2008cfe5840e781eeb40b25590b88
msgid "Use of electric and engine governors"
msgstr "电子调速器和发动机调速器的使用"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:33
#: a2c003297d2f4b3599ad699dfbd4fc24
msgid ""
"If you intend to use any Copter flight control modes other than Acro and "
"Stabilize, it is recommended that the speed controller you purchase for an "
"electric helicopter have a governor mode. For piston and turbine engines a "
"governor is required. This is because Copter will be controlling the pitch "
"of the main blades automatically along with its internal throttle control "
"system. The throttle curve in ArduPilot will be used for fallback and "
"feedforward for piston and turbine engines in the event the governor fails "
"in flight, and for faster governor response on high collective pitch "
"loading."
msgstr ""
"如果您打算使用 Acro 和 Stabilize 以外的任何 Copter "
"飞行控制模式，建议您为电动直升机购买具有调速器模式的电调。活塞和涡轮发动机则必须使用调速器。这是因为 Copter "
"将自动控制主桨的桨距及其内部油门控制系统。在调速器失效时，ArduPilot "
"中的油门曲线将用于活塞和涡轮发动机的备份和前馈，并在高总距负载时提供更快的调速器响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:42
#: b1f1cc16c7294d4992c9e05a865561f7
msgid ""
"For electric helicopters ArduPilot will set the throttle for the ESC "
"governor to hold the headspeed constant at all times."
msgstr "对于电动直升机，ArduPilot 将设置 ESC 调速器的油门，以始终保持恒定转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:46
#: 5d45f1d6fefd4e4fa62bb9e5a46f3ab7
msgid "Digital servos"
msgstr "数字舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:48
#: db4ce545782242e994f181ac826d5f17
msgid ""
"You should use digital servos instead of analog. Digital servos have much "
"faster response time, more accurate positioning, and your helicopter will "
"fly much more accurate and stable with digital servos."
msgstr "您应该使用数字舵机而非模拟舵机。数字舵机响应速度更快，定位更精确，使用数字舵机后直升机飞行将更加精确稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:53
#: 6cd5127f2c904233af2915c54ff6c8a2
msgid "Batteries"
msgstr "电池"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-heli-parts-list.rst:55
#: 1ffc2cf8e5d148089d37c3952b6ab0cf
msgid ""
"There are no special requirements for flight batteries. However, as a "
"general rule, it is safer if you can have a separate motor battery and radio"
" battery on electric helicopters. Electric motor power systems can have very"
" high power draw in helicopters. Having separate batteries will prevent "
"\"brownout\" of power to the flight electronics."
msgstr ""
"飞行电池没有特殊要求。但通常来说，电动直升机使用独立的电机电池和无线电电池更为安全。电动直升机的电机电源系统功耗可能非常高，使用独立电池可以防止飞行电子设备因\"欠压\"而断电。"
